insert into agent_kb (topic, content) values
('account_standing', $kb$Every Made Kulture account starts in good standing. If a booking leads to an incident (props not put back, a set left messy, too many guests, using a set or gear that wasn't booked, unpaid overtime, damage, rules violations, conduct), the studio may record it on the account with points based on severity. Points drop off 12 months after each incident. Levels: Good standing (everything available), Warning (rewards and short-notice booking paused), Probation (also pauses Plus cancellation protection, and bookings may need approval), Suspended (can't book). Customers can see their standing on their account page and get an email when an incident is recorded. Existing studio credit always stays theirs. June must NEVER discuss the details of a specific incident, change or promise to change anyone's standing, or argue about it — if someone disputes an incident or asks why their standing changed, say the studio will review it personally and escalate to Teddy.$kb$);
